{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "489a99982151b2a7ce6ee98d73a1e1ccd05f5487aca7cdf98f6cbd97b47ae789", "ja": "選んだ理由", "zh": "选择的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "078d5c0604fccc9cacdcef0b5289c6c733f7ce057905c6d0b41487d2c606877d", "ja": "3人目のメンバーとして声をかけられた\n亜美は大喜びで参加を引き受けるが、\n真美から待ったがかかる。真美ではない\n理由を問われた律子は真摯に答え、真美も\n納得。正式に『竜宮小町』が始動する。", "zh": "作为第3名成员受到邀请的\n亚美欣喜若狂地答应参加，\n但真美却出面喊停。面对真美询问\n为何不是自己的理由，律子真诚地做出回答，\n真美也表示理解。“龙宫小町”正式启动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6bd7f8b734b42d0fee520fd11814cb69cb9bece576c9a6b9f58bd1efa37ac19c", "ja": "（律子による、新ユニットのスカウトが進んでいる。\n伊織とあずささんに続く、最後のひとりは……）", "zh": "（律子正在进行新组合的招募。\n继伊织和阿姨之后，最后一个人会是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "e572e25e48e48be559dd29d092328e599c9bdd132556db4db4efeebf19afa7f1", "ja": "んっふっふっふ～♪　亜美を誘うなんて、\nさすが律っちゃん！　お目が高いね、意識高いね！", "zh": "嗯哼哼哼～♪ 居然会邀请亚美，真不愧是律子姐！眼光真好，品位也高嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "d08b1b59dd8fa36cdcaf2a6caa9577f5ae91ac62a295df72aa9f843b96842871", "ja": "もちろん亜美がんばるよ！　律っちゃんプロデュースの\nユニット、めーっちゃ盛り上げてあげる！", "zh": "当然啦，亚美会加油的！律子制作的组合，就让亚美来把气氛炒得超级热闹吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "a05da73812e93ab74578e9993dd12e8cb62d0a5b31aa50a654cd43e5c50905bf", "ja": "ありがとう、素直に嬉しいわ。\nこれからもよろしくね、亜美！", "zh": "谢谢，我真的很开心。\n今后也请多多关照，亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1647300451b7ad90f5aaf1bb0ca78edc39f46a0239a962357b00b3fa06a80acc", "ja": "よし、無事に新ユニット完成だな。\n早速、社長に報告を……。", "zh": "好，新的组合顺利完成了。\n赶紧向社长报告……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "6b729db2cae80aff9d9789d211d9134c6c2d2f2f2c774af5bddcec622f2be9f3", "ja": "ちょーっと待ったーっ！！", "zh": "等一下——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "dabeaf0211feb6a4ab0a77fb353304bd7210ba75678da22fcaa6fe889d6cd0e6", "ja": "え、真美！？", "zh": "咦，真美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "a33c0baea19f90fa6753f69576400ff8fdc068583266b632a1332a621f88a931", "ja": "律っちゃんどうして！？　亜美だけ誘うとか\nズルいよ～！　真美とのことは遊びだったの！？", "zh": "律子怎么这样！？只邀请亚美也太狡猾了～！跟真美之前难道只是玩玩而已吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "5a58e65e84331ba568511fdc7a512218a75ae8645087c96171f26895b2614e1c", "ja": "なあに、そのノリは。……ええと。\nなんで双子でユニットに誘わなかったか、って話？", "zh": "什么反应啊。……呃。\n你是说，为什么没邀请你们双胞胎一起组成组合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "085ecd520d506d397e10581ae269c6be54f2cd8b50a32788a1a87e8393dad036", "ja": "もちろん二人を揃えるパターンも考えたわよ。でも三人\nならではのトライアングルも、大事なコンセプトなの。", "zh": "当然我也考虑过让你们两个一起加入的方案哦。但正因为是三个人才能构成的三角平衡，也是非常重要的理念呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "34ba22638883a32cd9dfdc6aa4d3804d15a7351e855511d42e0fc5eb18aa9aee", "ja": "トライアングルでもカスタネットでもいいけど～！\nこれ、律っちゃんが考えたユニットなんでしょ？", "zh": "三角铁还是响板都行啦～！这可是律子姐想出来的组合，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "a17b1a71ec3531949b4f4cefda27d7ab50fb905407dd22c48cbbd91897059a31", "ja": "そこにいるのが、なんで真美じゃなくて亜美なの？\n真美にはそこが大事なのっ！", "zh": "为什么在那里的是亚美，而不是真美？\n那个位置对真美来说很重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "f9d1763269ce415c51bea3b824a6f647bacb4025e4174c2d836adb24f3ce9b7d", "ja": "真美……、そういうことか。\nうーん、それは、なんていうか……。", "zh": "真美……原来是这么回事啊。\n嗯——这个嘛，该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "a0c2315d6d38c28673b495fe16e4dcf55561c149ecc799dfca2fe54647528f61", "ja": "フッ。どうやら今回は亜美の勝ちのようだね、真美。\nお子ちゃまはまつ毛を洗って出直してきな！", "zh": "哼。看来这次是亚美赢了呢，真美。小屁孩，洗洗睫毛再回来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "a6efe9c81a067bf20a6eb01c472477dc547999dee6b21c618799b0baea705f7f", "ja": "真美より亜美のほうがお子ちゃまじゃん！\n今日の朝は真美の方が背も高かったし～！", "zh": "明明是亜美比真美更像小孩子嘛！  \n今天早上真美也比亜美高嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "a2083a6a073535b4c01ff7e77de98cb204f13342c260d56b6234d7d02405a919", "ja": "昨日とおとといは亜美が高かったー！\nあと今日の朝ごはんも先に食べ終わったー！", "zh": "昨天和前天都是亚美比较高——！\n还有今天早饭也是亚美先吃完的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "8a0d68fe2784d82ab01c9a69a8ae814bb1cf6bc1b2966ab5133a4899183dd506", "ja": "ぐぬぬぬぬぬ～！！", "zh": "咕嘟嘟嘟嘟～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "8a0d68fe2784d82ab01c9a69a8ae814bb1cf6bc1b2966ab5133a4899183dd506", "ja": "ぐぬぬぬぬぬ～！！", "zh": "咕嘟嘟嘟嘟～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "73677715a296d5491f7758832534ae8bd86cfc96a81f4be947653d3037656961", "ja": "はいはいそこまで、不毛な争いはやめなさーい！\n……で、真美。まずは立候補してくれてありがとう。", "zh": "好了好了，到此为止，别再进行这种毫无意义的争论啦！\n……话说回来，真美，首先谢谢你主动报名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "3fc1f7b827774287d521dd3b5cb1ff1ee3b4b8d98803abec50beee0ea48a8cbf", "ja": "でもね。ふたりが一番よくわかってると思うけど、\n真美には真美、亜美には亜美の個性があるわ。", "zh": "不过呢。你们两个人应该最清楚不过了吧，真美有真美的个性，亚美也有亚美的个性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "69577858f0fcd6da3b1950e148666cbd53d340c344014c49bb9d3910ef80c2cc", "ja": "今回のメンバーを考えた時、私は真美よりもちょっと\nだけ自由で甘えん坊な、亜美にいてほしいと思った。", "zh": "考虑这次的成员时，我希望在场的是比真美稍微更自由、也更爱撒娇的亚美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "9bd7b32e2abc9a769f945e8913e95b69e40871becd79be2245a0d1e401844768", "ja": "もちろん亜美より真美にいてほしい構成もある。\nただ今回は、亜美……そう思ったの。", "zh": "当然也有比起亚美，我更希望真美在场的安排。\n但这一次，我想要的是亚美……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "8de0e66fb6ce90422a2c5c8979dd493d2877121c89237799e774ab6c27f24016", "ja": "……。そっかー。", "zh": "……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "269e916dc5bb9651335d8d8a9704c210679a9d05490933d5d512cfaf037df89e", "ja": "わかったよ！　……ホントはよくわかんないけど、\n律っちゃんがいろいろ考えてくれたのは、わかった！", "zh": "我懂啦！……虽然其实没怎么听懂，\n但我明白小律子替我们考虑了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1024_011ami", "source_sha256": "de2cd1e51463fda3df0bfd53669bfa2da05e85232f9bd17bfb5762c9cc06b342", "ja": "うんうん。ホントは亜美もよくわかってないけど、\nなんか今回は、亜美の出番だって思った！", "zh": "嗯嗯。其实亚美也没太明白，不过总觉得这次该轮到亚美出场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba32feeec4b9a2c8020607116c05d680e651809f55587049e5682927925d5f56", "ja": "んじゃ、がんばってね亜美！\nちゃんと律っちゃんの顔にドロを塗りたくるんだよ！", "zh": "那就加油吧，亚美！\n一定要狠狠地给律子脸上抹黑哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1026_011ami", "source_sha256": "1f0c6f6d676c9170ebb038a605b1cabdfb45c5600f73c9067477d3d8045c4887", "ja": "うんっ、バケツ一杯分用意しとくね！\nばいばーい！", "zh": "嗯，我会准备满满一桶的！\n拜拜——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "ec339619292efa20d1e856c55e8541c6f1748e86439b0f2007fe4ef6c8c603e0", "ja": "……ふーん。\n本人を前にしていい度胸ね、亜美？", "zh": "……哼～\n当着本人的面，胆子挺大的嘛，亚美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "ed385bdd249093355457a7c4b70f50c73e83b99505d74540a95f2d8abb88b0f8", "ja": "あうあう！　律っちゃんが鬼グンソー化してる！\n真美、待って～っ！　一瞬代わって～っ！！", "zh": "啊呜啊呜！律变成魔鬼军曹了！\n真美，等一下～！来替我一会儿～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "60436afe71befc8d4d7e09530498bd451c96014e32c19db5c66f195d555af6ae", "ja": "……もう。殊勝なこと言いに来てくれた～、\nなんて思ったそばからこれなんだから……。", "zh": "……真是的。才刚觉得“特地跑来说这么懂事的话呀～”，\n转眼就变成这副德行了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f6b3f0d0f9d5ea0fbe52c6636f1f320198429e0c8e5f31de31b909d68d6e5cc2", "ja": "でも、律子も嬉しそうだな。", "zh": "不过，律子看起来也很高兴啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "b7460640cbb196f2ec3875323140f442cd7eb80eae3f328149b860194c7ef2fd", "ja": "……。\nまあ、そこはね♪", "zh": "……  \n嗯，那方面嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1032_null", "source_sha256": "b51dfd95602ddeba2076b904866bddd2d33de5044a97d39d914d7a5836a1edaa", "ja": "そして…………", "zh": "然后…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1033_president", "source_sha256": "4265a5f8408102fe4775b58e031ba95ed81e61ccd7a6f20691e520cb53dc5bd7", "ja": "『竜宮小町』……！", "zh": "“龙宫小町”……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
