{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "bae61095b0b741eb58c1467cc307c78fbc6f0dc29896d394ad6f2312b838c4c2", "ja": "はい。なんとなくですけど、メンバー全員の名前に\n水に関する漢字があるので、そこからの連想で。", "zh": "是的。该怎么说呢，只是因为想到成员们每个人的名字里都有和水有关的汉字，就联想到这个名字了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1036_president", "source_sha256": "289af510e63513f1058acb44239ab0bfd883c2d3786ff28dfb75c97fa3f051d1", "ja": "うむ、いいユニット名じゃないか。\n律子君、それで行こう！", "zh": "嗯，这个组合名挺不错的嘛。\n律子，就定这个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "99028d6fecbba141867b0873fd2377b68e43b4635db3ade0347e44e38df4415c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　やった！", "zh": "谢谢！太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "721e2b07fac35266b46301636e4631dec01befca01ea7b88207b0642eb809ebf", "ja": "社長や{$P$}さんが作るユニットとは\nひと味違う雰囲気になりそうですね♪", "zh": "感觉会和社长还有{$P$}先生组建的组合有所不同呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "39b1ee0c1f6d1b9ed89ddf66ad07d83f7d63fdfe7b645f6da24ff3c85e51e817", "ja": "どうでしょう。そのあたりは私がどうこうじゃなくて、\n本人たちに期待しています♪", "zh": "怎么样呢？这方面并不是由我来决定，而是要期待她们自己的表现♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1040_president", "source_sha256": "542ac20d20cda1d5092c19b1fc87a41fa4c774565eeddce7b2e84007215c6534", "ja": "いやはや、頼もしい限りだ。君も先輩プロデューサーと\nして、うかうかしていられないね？", "zh": "哎呀，真是可靠啊。你作为前辈制作人，也不能掉以轻心了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "6534d8a11e05da007082bfa350e05ab0391c78e9201ab48ab2807b6d148788be", "ja": "そうですね。いろいろ参考にさせてもらおうかと。", "zh": "是啊，我也想从各个方面好好参考一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "6fef89088ac2b405db188b04f1e05a3d45d0f35e86a0cdda4cb2e2d9793afe68", "ja": "いや、そこはいろいろ教えてくださいよ。\n頼りにしてますからね、先輩♪", "zh": "不，那里就请你多教教我了。\n我可是很依赖你的，前辈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1043_president", "source_sha256": "cba001eea6e3fe0e946d6e3a8e030a26ad4fbff7fca6a86410984b0239fdb62f", "ja": "はっはっは！　先輩として、\nしっかりフォローしてあげてくれたまえ！", "zh": "哈哈哈！作为前辈，  \n可要好好关照他们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "eaf7cb699525b1c632761eebfc5d80bca65b500c164f816844bb8b7f69ca6dd2", "ja": "（竜宮小町……本当に、特別な存在になる予感がする。\n律子にとっても、765プロにとっても）", "zh": "（龙宫小町……我有种预感，她们真的会成为特别的存在。无论对律子，还是对765制作人来说。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
